@startuml
title WiFiManager - Architecture

actor "Application" as App

rectangle "WiFiManager API" as API
queue "Command Queue" as Queue
rectangle "WiFiManagerTask" as Task
rectangle "ESP32 WiFi" as WiFi
database "Preferences" as Flash
rectangle "RAM Data" as RAM

' ===== Command =====
App --> API : requestConnect()\nrequestDisconnect()\nrequestScan()

API --> Queue : WiFiCommand
Queue --> Task : Command

App --> API : requestCancelConnect()
API --> Task : cancelRequested

Task --> WiFi : Connect / Disconnect / Scan
WiFi --> Task : Result

' ===== Data =====
Task --> RAM : Update state/results
Task --> Flash : Save / Load WiFi

App --> API : Getter functions
API --> RAM : Read data
API --> WiFi : Read WiFi info

@enduml